# are case- and extension-sensitive and miss things like
# notes/wo-gl4-1-gllite-videocore-iv.html. Planning docs belong in
# ~/github/SS/notes; anything landing here is a scratch copy.
notes/
HANDOVER*
WORK_ORDER*
*WORK-ORDER*
*WORK_ORDER*
WO-*.md
*_PLAN.md
*_SCOPE.md

# make-sdcard.sh outputs + caches
/blobs/
/.sdcard-work/
/*.img
/*.img.xz

# local session notes for AI tooling -- never committed
CLAUDE.local.md
